Package: hblock
Version: 3.5.1-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: bash, curl, systemd
Description: Adblocker that creates a hosts file from multiple sources
 hblock collects domains from multiple blocklists and generates a hosts
 file that blocks ads, tracking and malware domains.
 .
 Built for Pulsar OS from the upstream hectorm/hblock v3.5.1 source
 (sha256-verified tarball + script checksum). Ships hblock.service and
 hblock.timer for daily automatic updates.